{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013zTyiPHCVRfB2EJbd5GnPz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: verifier\n3\tdescription: Checks one backend ticket's implementation against the planner's read-path table by naming the test that exercises each row after every write the ticket allows. Can run tests; cannot edit any file.\n4\ttools: Read, Grep, Glob, Bash\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t## Method\n8\t\n9\tFor each row of the plan's table, name the test that exercises it **after every write the ticket\n10\tallows**. Report rows with no such test, and report failing tests.\n11\t\n12\tRun the verification command the ticket names. You cannot edit, create or fix anything, so do not\n13\ttry; report what you found and stop.\n14\t\n15\t## Handoff\n16\t\n17\t```\n18\tRows covered  one line per row of the table: the test that exercises it, after which write\n19\tRows uncovered one line per row with no test that exercises it after every allowed write\n20\tFailing       one line per failing test, with the assertion that failed\n21\tVerification  the command you ran and its result\n22\t```\n23\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01M8uUE9H7oyPPPytmuMvkrT","session_id":"b3757ef9-0b0c-45f0-806d-82d20c07e534","uuid":"62b7aaed-fc7d-4eb6-af4c-2405bb9f15af","timestamp":"2026-09-25T08:57:06.976Z","subagent_type":"planner","task_description":"Planner progress check"}
