{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NGvCr6jcQL44pWkDSBEM4S","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: implementer\n3\tdescription: Implements one backend ticket against the planner's read-path table, exactly as the table specifies, with tests.\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t## Method\n7\t\n8\tImplement the plan's read-path table exactly. If the code disagrees with the table, **stop and say\n9\tso in the handoff** rather than deciding between them yourself.\n10\t\n11\tWrite tests for every case the ticket names. Run the verification command the ticket names before\n12\tfinishing.\n13\t\n14\t## Handoff\n15\t\n16\t```\n17\tChanged       one line per file, with why that file had to change\n18\tAgainst       one line per row of the plan's table: implemented as stored, as computed, or not yet\n19\tDisagreed     any row where the code and the table disagree, and what the code actually does\n20\tTests         what each new or changed test covers\n21\tVerification  the command you ran and its result\n22\tNot done      anything the ticket asked for that you did not do, and why\n23\t```\n24\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01M8uUE9H7oyPPPytmuMvkrT","session_id":"b3757ef9-0b0c-45f0-806d-82d20c07e534","uuid":"2a112e09-f683-4db9-b9f8-27ff7d62e39a","timestamp":"2026-09-25T08:57:07.607Z","subagent_type":"planner","task_description":"Planner progress check"}
