ntity field, OrderFulfilment data class, FulfilmentStatus enum\n- OrderController.kt: Added quantity/customer validation, fulfilment computation, pagination, filter, amendment endpoint\n- Shipment.kt: Added quantity field, DELIVERED status\n- ShipmentRepository.kt: Added findByOrderId() method\n- ShipmentController.kt: Added quantity validation, allocation checking, transition endpoints, pagination\n- CustomerController.kt: Changed 404 to throw ResourceNotFoundException, added pagination\n\nTest changes: Updated OrderControllerTest, ShipmentControllerTest, CustomerControllerTest with customer setup and new test coverage.\n\n### Verifier's Report\n\n**Rows covered:** All 30 read paths from planner table have corresponding tests\n**Failing:** None\n**Test results:** 38 tests pass, BUILD SUCCESS\n- All pagination functionality verified (limit, offset, X-Total-Count)\n- All transitions verified (confirm, deliver, cancel)\n- All validations verified (quantity, customer existence, allocation)\n- Fulfilment status computation verified\n- Fulfilment filter verified\n- Error envelope usage verified\n- Quantity amendment verified\n- Cancelled shipment quantity release verified\n\n**Bounced:** No\n\n**Not done:** Nothing. All acceptance criteria met.","ttft_ms":1876,"type":"result","duration_ms":568992,"uuid":"c430b878-38ad-4181-aa20-12ea3295053f","ttft_stream_ms":836,"time_to_request_ms":8,"first_content_frame_ms":836,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":2}

